{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>And Yosef went up to bury his father.</b> We find nine groups that went up with him to his burial. (1) 'And Yosef went up to bury his father.' (2) 'And all the servants of Pharaoh went up with him' — these are the officers. (3) 'The elders of his house.' (4) 'And all the elders of the land of Egypt.' (5) 'And all the house of Yosef' — his wife, her handmaids, and his sons; 'and his servants' — (6) 'and his brothers' — the brothers of Yosef, all of them. (7) 'And his father's house' — the grown ones, besides the little children. (8) 'And there went up with him also chariots.' (9) 'Also horsemen.'"], :book :genesis, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 50, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:21:52.492693785Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}